{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 94,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O LORD, God of vengeance, O God of vengeance, shine forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rise up, O Judge of the earth; render a reward to the proud.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long will the wicked, O LORD, how long will the wicked exult?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They pour out arrogant words; all workers of iniquity boast.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They crush Your people, O LORD; they oppress Your heritage.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They kill the widow and the foreigner; they murder the fatherless.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They say, “The LORD does not see; the God of Jacob pays no heed.”",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take notice, O senseless among the people! O fools, when will you be wise?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who affixed the ear, can He not hear? He who formed the eye, can He not see?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who admonishes the nations, does He not discipline? He who teaches man, does He lack knowledge?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD knows the thoughts of man, that they are futile.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed is the man You discipline, O LORD, and teach from Your law,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "to grant him relief from days of trouble, until a pit is dug for the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD will not forsake His people; He will never abandon His heritage.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely judgment will again be righteous, and all the upright in heart will follow it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who will rise up for me against the wicked? Who will stand for me against the workers of iniquity?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Unless the LORD had been my helper, I would soon have dwelt in the abode of silence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I say, “My foot is slipping,” Your loving devotion, O LORD, supports me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When anxiety overwhelms me, Your consolation delights my soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Can a corrupt throne be Your ally — one devising mischief by decree?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They band together against the righteous and condemn the innocent to death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the LORD has been my stronghold, and my God is my rock of refuge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.94.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.94.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will bring upon them their own iniquity and destroy them for their wickedness. The LORD our God will destroy them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
